{"t":"Bunch of Wheat","s":"bunch-of-wheat-c874a","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Bunch_of_Wheat_392881.gif","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Bunch of Wheat</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Bunch of Wheat\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bunch_of_Wheat_392881.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Plants, Animal Products, Food and Drink<br/>Plants and Herbs</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">12.50 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Negotiable</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1 gp</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">October 28, 1997<br/>Alpha 3.0</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20210713214839&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bunch_of_Wheat_392881.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a bunch of wheat.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 12.50 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Cut wheat using a <a href=\"#/wiki/Scythe\">scythe</a> and then use it with a <a href=\"#/wiki/Millstone\">millstone</a> to make <a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">flour</a>, then use the <a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">flour</a> with a bucket or trough of water to make dough, then use the dough with an oven to make <a href=\"#/wiki/Bread\">bread</a>. Replacing the water with <a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">milk</a>, you get a <a href=\"#/wiki/Cake\">cake</a>.\n</p><p>To make <a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20Oat\">Sugar Oat</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20Oat\"><img alt=\"Sugar Oat\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sugar_Oat_8e0638.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span>, you need:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sickle\">Sickle</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Scythe\">Scythe</a></li>\n<li>Bunch of Sugar Cane</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wheat\">Wheat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bug\">Fire Bug</a></li></ul>\n<ol><li>Travel to <a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty bay</a> and buy <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bug\">Fire Bugs</a> from Evan <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32259,32881,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32259, 32881, 7)</a>.</li>\n<li>Go to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20Cane\">Sugar Canes</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32227,32797,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32227, 32797, 7)</a> and use the <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bug\">Fire Bugs</a> to burn the <a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20Cane\">Sugar Canes</a> down.</li>\n<li>Pick up the Bunch of Sugar Canes and travel to <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> wheat field <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32437,32246,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32437, 32246, 7)</a>.</li>\n<li>Cut down the wheat with the <a href=\"#/wiki/Scythe\">Scythe</a>.</li>\n<li>Use the Bunch of Wheat on the Bunch of Sugar Cane.</li></ol>\n<p>Note: You can use the <a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20Oat\">Sugar Oats</a> on <a href=\"#/wiki/Wild%20Horse\">Wild Horse</a> to get the <a href=\"#/wiki/War%20Horse\">War Horse</a> mount.\n</p><p><br/>\nA lot of bunches of wheat can be found at daily spawns in one of the buildings in <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a>, here.<br/>\nCut 200 of these to obtain the Happy Farmer achievement.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blightwalker\">Blightwalker</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buyfrom\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Donald%20McRonald\">Donald McRonald</a></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blightwalker\">Blightwalker</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/blood-brothers-quest\">Blood Brothers Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bread\">Bread</a></li><li>Bunch of Sugar Cane</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake\">Cake</a></li><li>Cooking</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Donald%20McRonald\">Donald McRonald</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bug\">Fire Bug</a></li><li>Flooring</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">Flour</a></li><li>Grass</li><li>Happy Farmer</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Invisibility\">Invisibility</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">Milk</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Millstone\">Millstone</a></li><li>Old Sprites</li><li>Plants and Herbs</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Scythe\">Scythe</a></li><li>Shops</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sickle\">Sickle</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20Cane\">Sugar Cane</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20Oat\">Sugar Oat</a></li><li>Transmutator</li><li>Undead Humanoids</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wheat\">Wheat</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wheat%20Field\">Wheat Field</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["blood-brothers-quest","hot-cuisine-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"blood-brothers-quest","quest":"Blood Brothers Quest","step":"0-2","n":3,"title":"Arranjar os ingredientes","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":32314,"y":32266,"z":8,"label":"Henricus"}]},{"slug":"hot-cuisine-quest","quest":"Hot Cuisine Quest","step":"0-0","n":1,"title":"Fazer farinha em Thais","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":32391,"y":32229,"z":7,"label":"Donald McRonald"}]}],"buy":[{"npc":"Donald McRonald","where":"Thais","price":1,"pos":{"x":32391,"y":32229,"z":7},"href":"#/wiki/Donald%20McRonald"}],"drops":[{"creature":"Blightwalker","pct":50.259,"qty":"1","rarity":"comum","hp":"8,100","exp":"6,400","loc":"Pits of Inferno , Edron (In the Vats during The Inquisition Quest ), Roshamuul Prison and Grounds of Undeath .","places":[{"name":"Pits of Inferno","x":32837,"y":32235,"z":13,"href":"#/wiki/Pits%20of%20Inferno"},{"name":"Edron","x":33211,"y":31830,"z":7,"href":"#/wiki/Edron"},{"name":"The Inquisition Quest","x":32320,"y":32276,"z":7,"href":"#/quest/the-inquisition-quest"},{"name":"Grounds of Undeath","x":33394,"y":32336,"z":10,"href":"#/wiki/Grounds%20of%20Undeath"}],"href":"#/wiki/Blightwalker"}],"spots":[{"x":32259,"y":32881,"z":7,"text":"Travel to Liberty bay and buy Fire Bugs from Evan here ."},{"x":32227,"y":32797,"z":7,"text":"Go to the Sugar Canes here and use the Fire Bugs to burn the Sugar Canes down."},{"x":32437,"y":32246,"z":7,"text":"Pick up the Bunch of Sugar Canes and travel to Thais wheat field here ."}]}}